{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-5ab770d28136","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-5ab770d28136","name":"桂圆红枣粥","category":"breakfast","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/breakfast/%E6%A1%82%E5%9C%86%E7%BA%A2%E6%9E%A3%E7%B2%A5.md","blob_sha":"63da5ca4cd6201583ab6fedeaece6d2fe5fe57da","details":{"introduction":"一道甜香软糯的中式传统粥品。以糯米、红枣和桂圆同煮，自带甘甜，暖身暖胃。有补血安神、健脑益智、补养心脾的食养效果。做法非常友好，新手也能轻松掌握，从准备到粥香满屋大约需要 70 分钟。","difficulty":"★★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"- 糯米（或大米）\n- 红枣\n- 桂圆"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"每份：\n\n- 糯米 100g\n- 红枣 15 颗\n- 桂圆 15 颗"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 将桂圆肉扒出，用清水洗两次，放入碗中浸泡 10 分钟\n2. 红枣用清水洗两次，放入碗中浸泡 10 分钟\n3. 糯米放入电饭锅中，清水淘米两次后，加入 2000ml 水\n4. 将桂圆和红枣加入电饭锅\n5. 打开电饭锅煮饭模式，1 小时后粥成"},{"heading":"附加内容","markdown":"对粥的稀稠程度有不同喜好的朋友可以酌情增加或减少水的用量，煮出来的粥是甜的，可以通过控制加入桂圆的数量控制甜度"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"reference","basis":"per_100g","serving_g":null,"scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：生短粒白米100g、干红枣候选60g、干桂圆40g、饮用水1300g；整份约1300g。按原文允许的大米分支，红枣去核、桂圆去壳净量；无额外糖，粥汤全食。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","per_100g":{"energy_kcal":49.307692,"protein_g":0.868615,"carbohydrate_g":11.715385,"fat_g":0.075385},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168931/nutrients","version":"efd36e1d5c9e0c2d","fdc_ids":[168931,168152,169907,173647]},"profile_id":"family-5ab770d28136-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-5ab770d28136","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","is_estimate":true,"match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-5ab770d28136","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"simmer","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":false,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-5ab770d28136-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"rice_dry","grams":100},{"key":"dates","grams":60},{"key":"longan","grams":40},{"key":"water","grams":1300}],"excludes"